<unit id="f72d5ae7-804e-4f1f-92d3-1b80efe6d6e7">
<notes>
<note appliesTo="source">line: 10</note>
<note appliesTo="source">prefix: * </note>
</notes>
<segment>
<source>Enables NVDA to detect selection changes when UI Automation is disabled in Perky Duck. Without the add-on, NVDA detects these changes only when UI Automation is enabled.</source>
</segment>
</unit>
<unit id="5b1b611b-c4fc-46fc-a3a9-c1decdaf59ad">
<notes>
<note appliesTo="source">line: 11</note>
<note appliesTo="source">prefix: * </note>
</notes>
<segment>
<source>Adds the possibility of using the speak typed characters feature of NVDA in Perky Duck documents.</source>
</segment>
</unit>
