<unit id="af9ae2ef-5eb9-4dd4-a8b7-2df42744f80f">
<notes>
<note appliesTo="source">line: 15</note>
</notes>
<segment>
<source>The following commands can be assigned from NVDA's menu, Preferences submenu, Input gestures dialog, Perky Duck category. This will be available from Perky Duck documents:</source>
</segment>
</unit>
<unit id="c06409dc-4919-40aa-918e-5f99c7a28788">
<notes>
<note appliesTo="source">line: 17</note>
<note appliesTo="source">prefix: * </note>
</notes>
<segment>
<source>Shows the selected text converted to braille using symbols for the current language.</source>
</segment>
</unit>
